(879,1635,$mw$24FE40120398154B57035125AF10DE12F61F8F58098F492D469163840BC941FB$mw$,$mw$89dbac342c5ef10ce6595f2253c86bc2$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1635,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما ناتج $\\frac34+\\frac18$ في أبسط صورة؟","TitleEn":"Find $\\frac34+\\frac18$ in simplest form.","QuestionTextAr":"ما ناتج $\\frac34+\\frac18$ في أبسط صورة؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find $\\frac34+\\frac18$ in simplest form.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لجمع كسرين بمقامين مختلفين نوحّد المقام أولاً، ثم نجمع البسطين مع إبقاء المقام. المقام المشترك بين 4 و8 هو 8؛ لذلك 3/4 = 6/8. بالتعويض: 6/8 + 1/8 = (6 + 1)/8 = 7/8. والكسر في أبسط صورة لأن 7 و8 لا قاسم مشترك بينهما غير 1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: To add fractions with different denominators, rewrite them with a common denominator and add their numerators. The least common denominator of 4 and 8 is 8, so 3/4 = 6/8. Then 6/8 + 1/8 = (6 + 1)/8 = 7/8. Since 7 and 8 are coprime, the result is simplified.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6529,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac78","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6530,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac58","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6531,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac48","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6532,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{11}8","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن مقام مشترك للربع والثمن.","En":"Find a common denominator for quarters and eighths."},{"Ar":"وحّد المقام ثم اجمع البسطين.","En":"Use the common denominator, then add numerators."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما ناتج $\\frac34+\\frac18$ في أبسط صورة؟","En":"Find $\\frac34+\\frac18$ in simplest form."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac78","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac58","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5/8 أصغر من 3/4 رغم إضافة كمية موجبة.","En":"5/8 is below 3/4 despite adding a positive quantity."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac48","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4/8 يجمع البسطين قبل توحيد المقام.","En":"4/8 adds numerators before making denominators common."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{11}8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11/8 أكبر من الواحد، بينما المجموع هنا أقل من الواحد.","En":"11/8 exceeds one, whereas this sum is below one."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما ناتج $\\frac34+\\frac18$ في أبسط صورة؟","En":"Find $\\frac34+\\frac18$ in simplest form."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات.","En":"Add fractions after finding a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المقام المشترك الأصغر للعددين 4 و8 هو 8، فنضرب بسط ومقام 3/4 في اثنين.","En":"The least common denominator is eight; multiply numerator and denominator of 3/4 by two."},{"Ar":"$\\frac34=\\frac68$","En":"$\\frac34=\\frac68$"},{"Ar":"نجمع البسطين 6 و1 ونبقي المقام 8؛ لا قاسم مشترك بين 7 و8 غير 1.","En":"Add six and one, retaining denominator eight; seven and eight are coprime."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac78$","En":"$\\frac78$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع البسطين قبل توحيد المقام.","En":"Do not add numerators before finding a common denominator."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd},\\quad bd\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac68+\\frac18=\\frac78$","En":"$\\frac68+\\frac18=\\frac78$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac78-\\frac18=\\frac34$","En":"$\\frac78-\\frac18=\\frac34$"}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":298,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن مقام مشترك للربع والثمن.","En":"Find a common denominator for quarters and eighths."},{"Ar":"وحّد المقام ثم اجمع البسطين.","En":"Use the common denominator, then add numerators."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات.","En":"Add fractions after finding a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المقام المشترك الأصغر للعددين 4 و8 هو 8، فنضرب بسط ومقام 3/4 في اثنين.","En":"The least common denominator is eight; multiply numerator and denominator of 3/4 by two."},{"Ar":"$\\frac34=\\frac68$","En":"$\\frac34=\\frac68$"},{"Ar":"نجمع البسطين 6 و1 ونبقي المقام 8؛ لا قاسم مشترك بين 7 و8 غير 1.","En":"Add six and one, retaining denominator eight; seven and eight are coprime."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac78$","En":"$\\frac78$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع البسطين قبل توحيد المقام.","En":"Do not add numerators before finding a common denominator."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd},\\quad bd\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac68+\\frac18=\\frac78$","En":"$\\frac68+\\frac18=\\frac78$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac78-\\frac18=\\frac34$","En":"$\\frac78-\\frac18=\\frac34$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5/8 أصغر من 3/4 رغم إضافة كمية موجبة.","En":"5/8 is below 3/4 despite adding a positive quantity."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4/8 يجمع البسطين قبل توحيد المقام.","En":"4/8 adds numerators before making denominators common."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11/8 أكبر من الواحد، بينما المجموع هنا أقل من الواحد.","En":"11/8 exceeds one, whereas this sum is below one."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نجمع الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات.

$\frac ab+\frac cd=\frac{ad+bc}{bd},\quad bd\ne0$

1. المقام المشترك الأصغر للعددين 4 و8 هو 8، فنضرب بسط ومقام 3/4 في اثنين.

2. $\frac34=\frac68$

3. نجمع البسطين 6 و1 ونبقي المقام 8؛ لا قاسم مشترك بين 7 و8 غير 1.

$\frac68+\frac18=\frac78$

$\frac78$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac78-\frac18=\frac34$

لا تجمع البسطين قبل توحيد المقام.$mw$,$mw$Add fractions after finding a common denominator.

$\frac ab+\frac cd=\frac{ad+bc}{bd},\quad bd\ne0$

1. The least common denominator is eight; multiply numerator and denominator of 3/4 by two.

2. $\frac34=\frac68$

3. Add six and one, retaining denominator eight; seven and eight are coprime.

$\frac68+\frac18=\frac78$

$\frac78$ Dimensionless

$\frac78-\frac18=\frac34$

Do not add numerators before finding a common denominator.$mw$),
(880,1636,$mw$C8B6627E954CB058EFF47B3C373A2532EFDAB3D22E47C77665A2F8D6EEC55C47$mw$,$mw$8dba62038871c5655ae44fd425828650$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1636,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب $\\frac56-\\frac13$ واكتب الناتج في أبسط صورة.","TitleEn":"Calculate $\\frac56-\\frac13$ in simplest form.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب $\\frac56-\\frac13$ واكتب الناتج في أبسط صورة.","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate $\\frac56-\\frac13$ in simplest form.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لطرح كسور ذات مقامات مختلفة نوحّد المقامات، ثم نطرح البسطين ونبسّط الناتج. نكتب 1/3 = 2/6 لأن 3 × 2 = 6. إذن 5/6 − 1/3 = 5/6 − 2/6 = (5 − 2)/6 = 3/6. بقسمة البسط والمقام على 3 نحصل على 1/2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: To subtract fractions, first express them over a common denominator, subtract the numerators, and simplify. Convert 1/3 to 2/6. Therefore 5/6 − 1/3 = 5/6 − 2/6 = (5 − 2)/6 = 3/6. Divide numerator and denominator by 3 to get the simplest form, 1/2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6533,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac23","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6534,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6535,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac16","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6536,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac35","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اختر مقاماً مشتركاً بين 6 و3.","En":"Choose a common denominator for six and three."},{"Ar":"اطرح البسطين بعد التوحيد واختصر الكسر.","En":"Subtract numerators after conversion and simplify."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب $\\frac56-\\frac13$ واكتب الناتج في أبسط صورة.","En":"Calculate $\\frac56-\\frac13$ in simplest form."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac23","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2/3 يساوي 4/6، أي طرح سدس واحد فقط.","En":"2/3 equals 4/6, subtracting only one sixth."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac16","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/6 يطرح أربعة أسداس بدلاً من اثنين.","En":"1/6 subtracts four sixths rather than two."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac35","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 لا ينتج من الطرح بالمقام المشترك.","En":"3/5 is not obtained by subtracting with a common denominator."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب $\\frac56-\\frac13$ واكتب الناتج في أبسط صورة.","En":"Calculate $\\frac56-\\frac13$ in simplest form."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات ثم نبسّط.","En":"Subtract fractions using a common denominator, then simplify."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى ستة بتحويل الثلث إلى سدسين.","En":"Use denominator six by converting one third into two sixths."},{"Ar":"$\\frac13=\\frac26$","En":"$\\frac13=\\frac26$"},{"Ar":"نطرح 2 من 5 ثم نبسط 3/6 بقسمة الطرفين على ثلاثة.","En":"Subtract two from five, then simplify 3/6 by dividing both terms by three."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح المقامات؛ حافظ على المقام المشترك ثم بسّط.","En":"Do not subtract denominators; keep the common denominator and simplify."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab-\\frac cd=\\frac{ad-bc}{bd},\\quad bd\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac56-\\frac26=\\frac36=\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac56-\\frac26=\\frac36=\\frac12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac56$","En":"$\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac56$"}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":298,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اختر مقاماً مشتركاً بين 6 و3.","En":"Choose a common denominator for six and three."},{"Ar":"اطرح البسطين بعد التوحيد واختصر الكسر.","En":"Subtract numerators after conversion and simplify."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات ثم نبسّط.","En":"Subtract fractions using a common denominator, then simplify."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى ستة بتحويل الثلث إلى سدسين.","En":"Use denominator six by converting one third into two sixths."},{"Ar":"$\\frac13=\\frac26$","En":"$\\frac13=\\frac26$"},{"Ar":"نطرح 2 من 5 ثم نبسط 3/6 بقسمة الطرفين على ثلاثة.","En":"Subtract two from five, then simplify 3/6 by dividing both terms by three."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح المقامات؛ حافظ على المقام المشترك ثم بسّط.","En":"Do not subtract denominators; keep the common denominator and simplify."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab-\\frac cd=\\frac{ad-bc}{bd},\\quad bd\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac56-\\frac26=\\frac36=\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac56-\\frac26=\\frac36=\\frac12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac56$","En":"$\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac56$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2/3 يساوي 4/6، أي طرح سدس واحد فقط.","En":"2/3 equals 4/6, subtracting only one sixth."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/6 يطرح أربعة أسداس بدلاً من اثنين.","En":"1/6 subtracts four sixths rather than two."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 لا ينتج من الطرح بالمقام المشترك.","En":"3/5 is not obtained by subtracting with a common denominator."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نطرح الكسور بعد توحيد المقامات ثم نبسّط.

$\frac ab-\frac cd=\frac{ad-bc}{bd},\quad bd\ne0$

1. نوحد المقام إلى ستة بتحويل الثلث إلى سدسين.

2. $\frac13=\frac26$

3. نطرح 2 من 5 ثم نبسط 3/6 بقسمة الطرفين على ثلاثة.

$\frac56-\frac26=\frac36=\frac12$

$\frac12$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac12+\frac13=\frac56$

لا تطرح المقامات؛ حافظ على المقام المشترك ثم بسّط.$mw$,$mw$Subtract fractions using a common denominator, then simplify.

$\frac ab-\frac cd=\frac{ad-bc}{bd},\quad bd\ne0$

1. Use denominator six by converting one third into two sixths.

2. $\frac13=\frac26$

3. Subtract two from five, then simplify 3/6 by dividing both terms by three.

$\frac56-\frac26=\frac36=\frac12$

$\frac12$ Dimensionless

$\frac12+\frac13=\frac56$

Do not subtract denominators; keep the common denominator and simplify.$mw$),
(881,1637,$mw$E22F526CA1FC26298DB47AD8C63785E9D9E46A72043D3944125B5175F9937D64$mw$,$mw$e75e0e1ebf10fee5382248e72c423ea9$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1637,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"في صندوق 18 كرة، ثلثاها زرقاء. كم كرة زرقاء؟","TitleEn":"A box holds 18 balls. Two-thirds are blue. How many are blue?","QuestionTextAr":"في صندوق 18 كرة، ثلثاها زرقاء. كم كرة زرقاء؟","QuestionTextEn":"A box holds 18 balls. Two-thirds are blue. How many are blue?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لإيجاد كسر من كمية نضرب الكمية في الكسر، أو نقسم على المقام ثم نضرب في البسط. العدد الكلي 18 كرة، والكرات الزرقاء ثلثاها. نحسب أولاً 18 ÷ 3 = 6 كرات لكل ثلث، ثم 6 × 2 = 12 كرة زرقاء. التحقق: 12/18 = 2/3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: To find a fraction of a quantity, multiply the total by that fraction or divide by the denominator and multiply by the numerator. Two-thirds of 18 balls is (18 ÷ 3) × 2 = 6 × 2 = 12 blue balls. Check that 12/18 simplifies to 2/3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6537,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6538,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6539,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6540,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قسّم الكرات إلى ثلاثة أقسام متساوية.","En":"Split the balls into three equal groups."},{"Ar":"خذ قسمين من الأقسام الثلاثة.","En":"Take two of the three equal groups."}],"Title":{"Ar":"في صندوق 18 كرة، ثلثاها زرقاء. كم كرة زرقاء؟","En":"A box holds 18 balls. Two-thirds are blue. How many are blue?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 يمثل ثلث الكرات لا ثلثيها.","En":"Six is one third of the balls, not two thirds."}},{"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9 نصف الكرات لا ثلثاها.","En":"Nine is half the balls, not two thirds."}},{"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"16 لا يساوي مجموع مجموعتين من ست كرات.","En":"Sixteen is not the total of two groups of six."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"في صندوق 18 كرة، ثلثاها زرقاء. كم كرة زرقاء؟","En":"A box holds 18 balls. Two-thirds are blue. How many are blue?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"جزء من كمية يساوي الكسر مضروباً في الكمية الكلية.","En":"A fraction of a quantity equals the fraction times the total."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كرة","En":"balls"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم 18 كرة إلى ثلاث مجموعات متساوية، كل مجموعة ست كرات.","En":"Split eighteen balls into three equal groups of six."},{"Ar":"$18/3=6$","En":"$18/3=6$"},{"Ar":"نأخذ مجموعتين لأن البسط اثنان؛ الناتج اثنتا عشرة كرة.","En":"Take two groups because the numerator is two; the result is twelve balls."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تتوقف عند قسمة العدد على المقام؛ اضرب في البسط.","En":"Do not stop after dividing by the denominator; multiply by the numerator."},"FormulaLatex":"B=\\frac23N","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\cdot6=12$","En":"$2\\cdot6=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$12/18=2/3$","En":"$12/18=2/3$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":298,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قسّم الكرات إلى ثلاثة أقسام متساوية.","En":"Split the balls into three equal groups."},{"Ar":"خذ قسمين من الأقسام الثلاثة.","En":"Take two of the three equal groups."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"جزء من كمية يساوي الكسر مضروباً في الكمية الكلية.","En":"A fraction of a quantity equals the fraction times the total."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كرة","En":"balls"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم 18 كرة إلى ثلاث مجموعات متساوية، كل مجموعة ست كرات.","En":"Split eighteen balls into three equal groups of six."},{"Ar":"$18/3=6$","En":"$18/3=6$"},{"Ar":"نأخذ مجموعتين لأن البسط اثنان؛ الناتج اثنتا عشرة كرة.","En":"Take two groups because the numerator is two; the result is twelve balls."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تتوقف عند قسمة العدد على المقام؛ اضرب في البسط.","En":"Do not stop after dividing by the denominator; multiply by the numerator."},"FormulaLatex":"B=\\frac23N","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\cdot6=12$","En":"$2\\cdot6=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$12/18=2/3$","En":"$12/18=2/3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 يمثل ثلث الكرات لا ثلثيها.","En":"Six is one third of the balls, not two thirds."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9 نصف الكرات لا ثلثاها.","En":"Nine is half the balls, not two thirds."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"16 لا يساوي مجموع مجموعتين من ست كرات.","En":"Sixteen is not the total of two groups of six."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$جزء من كمية يساوي الكسر مضروباً في الكمية الكلية.

$B=\frac23N$

1. نقسم 18 كرة إلى ثلاث مجموعات متساوية، كل مجموعة ست كرات.

2. $18/3=6$

3. نأخذ مجموعتين لأن البسط اثنان؛ الناتج اثنتا عشرة كرة.

$2\cdot6=12$

$12$ كرة

$12/18=2/3$

لا تتوقف عند قسمة العدد على المقام؛ اضرب في البسط.$mw$,$mw$A fraction of a quantity equals the fraction times the total.

$B=\frac23N$

1. Split eighteen balls into three equal groups of six.

2. $18/3=6$

3. Take two groups because the numerator is two; the result is twelve balls.

$2\cdot6=12$

$12$ balls

$12/18=2/3$

Do not stop after dividing by the denominator; multiply by the numerator.$mw$),
(882,1638,$mw$EE9EA070F297944976BCF8B98AB5A0BD165143503A1F338ED13F671809B3C2D4$mw$,$mw$c739885592a796b36e0b1a873fd2a439$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1638,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":21,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما ناتج $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ ككسر غير فعلي؟","TitleEn":"Find $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ as an improper fraction.","QuestionTextAr":"ما ناتج $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ ككسر غير فعلي؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ as an improper fraction.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: تحويل العدد الكسري إلى كسر غير فعلي يكون بضرب العدد الصحيح في المقام ثم إضافة البسط مع إبقاء المقام. بالتالي 1 و1/4 = (1 × 4 + 1)/4 = 5/4، و2 و1/2 = (2 × 2 + 1)/2 = 5/2 = 10/4. نجمع: 5/4 + 10/4 = 15/4 وهو الكسر غير الفعلي المطلوب.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Convert a mixed number to an improper fraction by multiplying the whole part by the denominator and adding the numerator. Thus 1 1/4 = (1×4+1)/4 = 5/4 and 2 1/2 = (2×2+1)/2 = 5/2 = 10/4. With common denominator 4, the sum is 5/4 + 10/4 = 15/4.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6541,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{11}4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6542,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{13}4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6543,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{14}4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6544,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}4","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل كل عدد كسري إلى كسر غير فعلي.","En":"Convert each mixed number to an improper fraction."},{"Ar":"وحّد المقام إلى أربعة ثم اجمع البسطين.","En":"Use denominator four and add the numerators."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما ناتج $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ ككسر غير فعلي؟","En":"Find $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ as an improper fraction."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac{11}4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11/4 أقل من مجموع الجزأين الصحيحين 3.","En":"11/4 is below the sum of whole parts, three."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{13}4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13/4 يساوي 3 و1/4، ويهمل النصف المضاف.","En":"13/4 is 3 and 1/4, omitting the added half."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{14}4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"14/4 يساوي 3 ونصف، ويهمل الربع المضاف.","En":"14/4 is 3 and a half, omitting the added quarter."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}4","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما ناتج $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ ككسر غير فعلي؟","En":"Find $1\\frac14+2\\frac12$ as an improper fraction."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحوّل الأعداد الكسرية إلى كسور غير فعلية ثم نجمع بمقام مشترك.","En":"Convert mixed numbers to improper fractions, then add using a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحول كل عدد كسري إلى كسر غير فعلي بضرب الجزء الصحيح في المقام وإضافة البسط.","En":"Convert each mixed number to an improper fraction by multiplying the whole part by the denominator and adding the numerator."},{"Ar":"$1\\frac14=\\frac54,\\quad2\\frac12=\\frac52=\\frac{10}4$","En":"$1\\frac14=\\frac54,\\quad2\\frac12=\\frac52=\\frac{10}4$"},{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى أربعة ثم نجمع البسطين؛ المطلوب كسر غير فعلي.","En":"Use common denominator four and add the numerators; an improper fraction is requested."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}4$","En":"$\\frac{15}4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المقامات أو تهمل الجزء الصحيح.","En":"Do not add denominators or omit whole parts."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\frac bc=\\frac{ac+b}{c}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac54+\\frac{10}4=\\frac{15}4$","En":"$\\frac54+\\frac{10}4=\\frac{15}4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}4=3+\\frac34$","En":"$\\frac{15}4=3+\\frac34$"}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":298,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل كل عدد كسري إلى كسر غير فعلي.","En":"Convert each mixed number to an improper fraction."},{"Ar":"وحّد المقام إلى أربعة ثم اجمع البسطين.","En":"Use denominator four and add the numerators."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحوّل الأعداد الكسرية إلى كسور غير فعلية ثم نجمع بمقام مشترك.","En":"Convert mixed numbers to improper fractions, then add using a common denominator."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحول كل عدد كسري إلى كسر غير فعلي بضرب الجزء الصحيح في المقام وإضافة البسط.","En":"Convert each mixed number to an improper fraction by multiplying the whole part by the denominator and adding the numerator."},{"Ar":"$1\\frac14=\\frac54,\\quad2\\frac12=\\frac52=\\frac{10}4$","En":"$1\\frac14=\\frac54,\\quad2\\frac12=\\frac52=\\frac{10}4$"},{"Ar":"نوحد المقام إلى أربعة ثم نجمع البسطين؛ المطلوب كسر غير فعلي.","En":"Use common denominator four and add the numerators; an improper fraction is requested."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}4$","En":"$\\frac{15}4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المقامات أو تهمل الجزء الصحيح.","En":"Do not add denominators or omit whole parts."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\frac bc=\\frac{ac+b}{c}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac54+\\frac{10}4=\\frac{15}4$","En":"$\\frac54+\\frac{10}4=\\frac{15}4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}4=3+\\frac34$","En":"$\\frac{15}4=3+\\frac34$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11/4 أقل من مجموع الجزأين الصحيحين 3.","En":"11/4 is below the sum of whole parts, three."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13/4 يساوي 3 و1/4، ويهمل النصف المضاف.","En":"13/4 is 3 and 1/4, omitting the added half."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"14/4 يساوي 3 ونصف، ويهمل الربع المضاف.","En":"14/4 is 3 and a half, omitting the added quarter."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نحوّل الأعداد الكسرية إلى كسور غير فعلية ثم نجمع بمقام مشترك.

$a\frac bc=\frac{ac+b}{c}$

1. نحول كل عدد كسري إلى كسر غير فعلي بضرب الجزء الصحيح في المقام وإضافة البسط.

2. $1\frac14=\frac54,\quad2\frac12=\frac52=\frac{10}4$

3. نوحد المقام إلى أربعة ثم نجمع البسطين؛ المطلوب كسر غير فعلي.

$\frac54+\frac{10}4=\frac{15}4$

$\frac{15}4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{15}4=3+\frac34$

لا تجمع المقامات أو تهمل الجزء الصحيح.$mw$,$mw$Convert mixed numbers to improper fractions, then add using a common denominator.

$a\frac bc=\frac{ac+b}{c}$

1. Convert each mixed number to an improper fraction by multiplying the whole part by the denominator and adding the numerator.

2. $1\frac14=\frac54,\quad2\frac12=\frac52=\frac{10}4$

3. Use common denominator four and add the numerators; an improper fraction is requested.

$\frac54+\frac{10}4=\frac{15}4$

$\frac{15}4$ Dimensionless

$\frac{15}4=3+\frac34$

Do not add denominators or omit whole parts.$mw$),
(883,1639,$mw$D68B7FE3ED638F14FF6B97753B6EA5B7E3271F7840BAE8FAB8C37237480449DA$mw$,$mw$d3c1f2a35ffe588f3eb2a4a2921651c8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1639,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":22,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما المتوسط الحسابي للبيانات 4، 7، 7، 10؟","TitleEn":"Find the mean of 4, 7, 7, and 10.","QuestionTextAr":"ما المتوسط الحسابي للبيانات 4، 7، 7، 10؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the mean of 4, 7, 7, and 10.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: المتوسط الحسابي = مجموع القيم ÷ عدد القيم. للبيانات 4 و7 و7 و10، نجمع أولاً 4 + 7 + 7 + 10 = 28. عدد المشاهدات 4، إذن المتوسط = 28 ÷ 4 = 7. وهو يعبر عن قيمة التوازن للمجموعة، وليس القيمة الأكثر تكراراً بالضرورة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Arithmetic mean = sum of observations ÷ number of observations. Add the four values 4 + 7 + 7 + 10 = 28. There are four observations, so the mean is 28 ÷ 4 = 7. This is the average, which is conceptually different from the mode or median.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6545,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6546,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6547,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6548,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مجموع المشاهدات كلها.","En":"Sum all observations."},{"Ar":"اقسم المجموع على عدد القيم مع احتساب المكرر.","En":"Divide by the number of values, counting repeated observations."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما المتوسط الحسابي للبيانات 4، 7، 7، 10؟","En":"Find the mean of 4, 7, 7, and 10."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 مضروباً في 4 يعطي 24 لا 28.","En":"Six times four is 24, not 28."}},{"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 مضروباً في 4 يعطي 32 لا 28.","En":"Eight times four is 32, not 28."}},{"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 أكبر مشاهدة لا المتوسط.","En":"Ten is the largest observation, not the mean."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما المتوسط الحسابي للبيانات 4، 7، 7، 10؟","En":"Find the mean of 4, 7, 7, and 10."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المتوسط الحسابي يساوي مجموع القيم على عددها.","En":"The arithmetic mean equals the sum divided by the count."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نجمع المشاهدات الأربع بما فيها القيمتان المتكررتان.","En":"Sum all four observations, including both repeated values."},{"Ar":"$4+7+7+10=28$","En":"$4+7+7+10=28$"},{"Ar":"نقسم المجموع 28 على عدد المشاهدات 4.","En":"Divide total 28 by the observation count four."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$7$","En":"$7$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف المشاهدات المتكررة عند حساب المتوسط.","En":"Do not remove repeated observations when calculating the mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\bar x=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i,\\quad n>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$28/4=7$","En":"$28/4=7$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$","En":"$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":22,"PrimarySkillId":299,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مجموع المشاهدات كلها.","En":"Sum all observations."},{"Ar":"اقسم المجموع على عدد القيم مع احتساب المكرر.","En":"Divide by the number of values, counting repeated observations."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المتوسط الحسابي يساوي مجموع القيم على عددها.","En":"The arithmetic mean equals the sum divided by the count."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نجمع المشاهدات الأربع بما فيها القيمتان المتكررتان.","En":"Sum all four observations, including both repeated values."},{"Ar":"$4+7+7+10=28$","En":"$4+7+7+10=28$"},{"Ar":"نقسم المجموع 28 على عدد المشاهدات 4.","En":"Divide total 28 by the observation count four."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$7$","En":"$7$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف المشاهدات المتكررة عند حساب المتوسط.","En":"Do not remove repeated observations when calculating the mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\bar x=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i,\\quad n>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$28/4=7$","En":"$28/4=7$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$","En":"$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 مضروباً في 4 يعطي 24 لا 28.","En":"Six times four is 24, not 28."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 مضروباً في 4 يعطي 32 لا 28.","En":"Eight times four is 32, not 28."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 أكبر مشاهدة لا المتوسط.","En":"Ten is the largest observation, not the mean."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المتوسط الحسابي يساوي مجموع القيم على عددها.

$\bar x=\frac1n\sum_{i=1}^n x_i,\quad n>0$

1. نجمع المشاهدات الأربع بما فيها القيمتان المتكررتان.

2. $4+7+7+10=28$

3. نقسم المجموع 28 على عدد المشاهدات 4.

$28/4=7$

$7$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$

لا تحذف المشاهدات المتكررة عند حساب المتوسط.$mw$,$mw$The arithmetic mean equals the sum divided by the count.

$\bar x=\frac1n\sum_{i=1}^n x_i,\quad n>0$

1. Sum all four observations, including both repeated values.

2. $4+7+7+10=28$

3. Divide total 28 by the observation count four.

$28/4=7$

$7$ Dimensionless

$(4-7)+(7-7)+(7-7)+(10-7)=0$

Do not remove repeated observations when calculating the mean.$mw$),
(884,1640,$mw$5F520C70D511E1B7842106B18E33B797166064E5176E9D67CC983E4AB28A151A$mw$,$mw$b49c6dcae55c9b3a8a3ae35e9a90728f$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1640,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":22,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما وسيط البيانات المرتبة 2، 5، 8، 12، 20؟","TitleEn":"Find the median of sorted data 2, 5, 8, 12, 20.","QuestionTextAr":"ما وسيط البيانات المرتبة 2، 5، 8، 12، 20؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the median of sorted data 2, 5, 8, 12, 20.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: الوسيط هو القيمة الوسطى بعد ترتيب البيانات. لدينا خمس قيم مرتبة: 2، 5، 8، 12، 20. عندما يكون عدد القيم فردياً، رتبة الوسيط = (ن + 1) ÷ 2؛ هنا (5 + 1) ÷ 2 = 3. القيمة الثالثة هي 8، إذن الوسيط = 8.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The median is the middle value after sorting observations. The ordered data are 2, 5, 8, 12, 20. For an odd count n, median position = (n+1)/2; with n = 5 the position is 3. The third value is 8, so the median is 8.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6549,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6550,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6551,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6552,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة؛ ابحث عن الرتبة الوسطى.","En":"The list is sorted; locate the middle rank."},{"Ar":"احسب رتبة الوسط واقرأ القيمة في ذلك الموضع.","En":"Calculate the middle rank and read that value."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما وسيط البيانات المرتبة 2، 5، 8، 12، 20؟","En":"Find the median of sorted data 2, 5, 8, 12, 20."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 القيمة الثانية لا الوسطى.","En":"Five is the second value, not the middle one."}},{"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 ليس قيمة الرتبة الثالثة؛ لا نحتاج متوسط قيمتين مع عدد فردي.","En":"Ten is not the third value; an odd count does not require averaging two values."}},{"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 القيمة الرابعة لا الوسطى.","En":"Twelve is the fourth value, not the middle one."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما وسيط البيانات المرتبة 2، 5، 8، 12، 20؟","En":"Find the median of sorted data 2, 5, 8, 12, 20."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط هو القيمة ذات الرتبة الوسطى في قائمة مرتبة فردية.","En":"The median is the middle-ranked value in an odd sorted list."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البيانات مرتبة بالفعل وعددها خمسة، وهو فردي.","En":"The data are already sorted and there are five observations, an odd count."},{"Ar":"$n=5,\\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$","En":"$n=5,\\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$"},{"Ar":"نحسب رتبة الوسط الثالثة ونقرأ القيمة في هذا الموضع؛ توجد قيمتان قبلها وقيمتان بعدها.","En":"The middle rank is third; read its value, with two observations on each side."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الوسيط بالمتوسط الحسابي أو رقم الرتبة.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the mean or the rank number."},"FormulaLatex":"j=(n+1)/2,\\quad n\\in\\{1,3,5,\\ldots\\}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x_3=8$","En":"$x_3=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2<5<8<12<20$","En":"$2<5<8<12<20$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":22,"PrimarySkillId":299,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة؛ ابحث عن الرتبة الوسطى.","En":"The list is sorted; locate the middle rank."},{"Ar":"احسب رتبة الوسط واقرأ القيمة في ذلك الموضع.","En":"Calculate the middle rank and read that value."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط هو القيمة ذات الرتبة الوسطى في قائمة مرتبة فردية.","En":"The median is the middle-ranked value in an odd sorted list."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البيانات مرتبة بالفعل وعددها خمسة، وهو فردي.","En":"The data are already sorted and there are five observations, an odd count."},{"Ar":"$n=5,\\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$","En":"$n=5,\\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$"},{"Ar":"نحسب رتبة الوسط الثالثة ونقرأ القيمة في هذا الموضع؛ توجد قيمتان قبلها وقيمتان بعدها.","En":"The middle rank is third; read its value, with two observations on each side."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الوسيط بالمتوسط الحسابي أو رقم الرتبة.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the mean or the rank number."},"FormulaLatex":"j=(n+1)/2,\\quad n\\in\\{1,3,5,\\ldots\\}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x_3=8$","En":"$x_3=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2<5<8<12<20$","En":"$2<5<8<12<20$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 القيمة الثانية لا الوسطى.","En":"Five is the second value, not the middle one."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 ليس قيمة الرتبة الثالثة؛ لا نحتاج متوسط قيمتين مع عدد فردي.","En":"Ten is not the third value; an odd count does not require averaging two values."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 القيمة الرابعة لا الوسطى.","En":"Twelve is the fourth value, not the middle one."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الوسيط هو القيمة ذات الرتبة الوسطى في قائمة مرتبة فردية.

$j=(n+1)/2,\quad n\in\{1,3,5,\ldots\}$

1. البيانات مرتبة بالفعل وعددها خمسة، وهو فردي.

2. $n=5,\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$

3. نحسب رتبة الوسط الثالثة ونقرأ القيمة في هذا الموضع؛ توجد قيمتان قبلها وقيمتان بعدها.

$x_3=8$

$8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2<5<8<12<20$

لا تخلط الوسيط بالمتوسط الحسابي أو رقم الرتبة.$mw$,$mw$The median is the middle-ranked value in an odd sorted list.

$j=(n+1)/2,\quad n\in\{1,3,5,\ldots\}$

1. The data are already sorted and there are five observations, an odd count.

2. $n=5,\quad j=(5+1)/2=3$

3. The middle rank is third; read its value, with two observations on each side.

$x_3=8$

$8$ Dimensionless

$2<5<8<12<20$

Do not confuse the median with the mean or the rank number.$mw$);
